{"3350870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GST Wars", "steam_appid": 3350870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a <strong>special battlefield</strong> where only the strongest survive!<br>In this fast-paced action game, you’ll <strong>select a unique character</strong>, each infused with their own <strong>DNA abilities</strong>, and enter an intense multiplayer arena filled with chaos and opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 <strong>Fight to win</strong> by battling other players, collecting coins, and climbing the leaderboard. Use your coins to <strong>unlock powerful new characters</strong> — each with different stats, powers, and playstyles. The more you fight, the more you earn. The more you earn, the stronger you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise to the top and become the <strong>richest and most feared warrior</strong> on the battlefield?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Fast-paced multiplayer battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧬 <strong>DNA-based character system</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 <strong>Earn and collect coins</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛍️ <strong>Unlock and buy new characters</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a <strong>special battlefield</strong> where only the strongest survive!<br>In this fast-paced action game, you’ll <strong>select a unique character</strong>, each infused with their own <strong>DNA abilities</strong>, and enter an intense multiplayer arena filled with chaos and opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 <strong>Fight to win</strong> by battling other players, collecting coins, and climbing the leaderboard. Use your coins to <strong>unlock powerful new characters</strong> — each with different stats, powers, and playstyles. The more you fight, the more you earn. The more you earn, the stronger you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise to the top and become the <strong>richest and most feared warrior</strong> on the battlefield?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Fast-paced multiplayer battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧬 <strong>DNA-based character system</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 <strong>Earn and collect coins</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛍️ <strong>Unlock and buy new characters</strong></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You need to select Character DNA to get power and join the battle", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350870/f3bc5e35e8ef6d3e52baa3d590616061d1d83082/header.jpg?t=1772826219", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350870/455d3433658863a6e59c4fdee586b8c27c3ddf4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772826219", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350870/455d3433658863a6e59c4fdee586b8c27c3ddf4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772826219", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 500 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0a<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Note